{
  "schema_version": "controller_reference_rag_v1",
  "description": "Formal Reference RAG for AdaptiveRAGPipeline.run(query): NQ-Train matched BGE FAISS + Qwen2.5-7B context_fallback. Aligns with feature/baseline-evaluation baselines/configs/rag_matched.json (FREEZE_CONTEXT_FALLBACK). Legacy Dev-index nq_bge_base is invalidated.",
